<title>JAPAN: Nikkei Dec options/futures SQ seen at 20,380.32.</title>
<headline>Nikkei Dec options/futures SQ seen at 20,380.32.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers said on Friday that they estimated that the Nikkei average's options and futures contracts for December would be settled at 20,380.32.</p>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange will announce official data on the settlement of options and futures after the market closes at 3 p.m. (0600 GMT).</p>
</text>
